      "id": "psychology-13",
      "beat": "discovery",
      "narration": "That kind of if-then plan is called an implementation intention. Research reviewed by Peter Gollwitzer describes how linking a situation to an action can help translate intentions into behavior. It is a tool, not a promise, and the chosen action still has to be feasible.",
